# Package Structure Guide

All packages are located in the [packages/](mdc:packages) directory. This monorepo contains the following key packages:

## Core Framework Packages

### [packages/shuvi/](mdc:packages/shuvi)
**Main CLI and framework package** - Assembles other packages for setting up development server and building production builds.

### [packages/runtime/](mdc:packages/runtime)
**Core runtime** - Core runtime components for applications.

### [packages/compiler/](mdc:packages/compiler)
**Build tooling** - Webpack and Babel configuration and compilation logic.

### [packages/compiler-swc/](mdc:packages/compiler-swc)
**SWC compiler integration** - Rust-based compiler for faster builds.

## Platform & Router Packages

### [packages/platform-web/](mdc:packages/platform-web)
**Web platform support** - Web-specific runtime and utilities.

### [packages/platform-shared/](mdc:packages/platform-shared)
**Shared platform code** - Common platform utilities.

### [packages/router/](mdc:packages/router)
**Core router** - Framework-agnostic routing logic.

### [packages/router-react/](mdc:packages/router-react)
**React router integration** - React-specific routing components.

## Development & Tooling

### [packages/create-shuvi/](mdc:packages/create-shuvi)
**Project scaffolding** - CLI tool for creating new Shuvi projects.

### [packages/eslint-config-shuvi/](mdc:packages/eslint-config-shuvi)
**ESLint configuration** - Shared ESLint rules and configuration.

### [packages/eslint-plugin-shuvi/](mdc:packages/eslint-plugin-shuvi)
**ESLint plugin** - Custom ESLint rules for Shuvi projects.

### [packages/error-overlay/](mdc:packages/error-overlay)
**Development error UI** - Error overlay for development mode.

## Utility Packages

### [packages/shared/](mdc:packages/shared)
**Shared utilities** - Reusable logic within the project.

### [packages/utils/](mdc:packages/utils)
**General utilities** - Generally reusable utility functions.

### [packages/service/](mdc:packages/service)
**Service layer** - Service-related functionality.

### [packages/toolpack/](mdc:packages/toolpack)
**Build configuration** - Webpack, Babel, and other tooling configurations.

### [packages/hook/](mdc:packages/hook)
**Hooks system** - Plugin and hook system for extensibility.

### [packages/reporters/](mdc:packages/reporters)
**Build reporters** - Progress and error reporting during builds.

## Examples & Tests

- **Examples**: [examples/](mdc:examples) - Sample applications demonstrating features
- **Tests**: [test/](mdc:test) - E2E and integration tests
- **Scripts**: [scripts/](mdc:scripts) - Build and release automation scripts
